# Repo-owned (created once by plokr-ci/sync.sh; never overwritten, not drift-checked).
# Accepted Trivy findings, one ID per line, each with a dated reason, e.g.:
#
# # 2026-12-31: base image has no fix yet; re-check at next Alpine release (#123)
# CVE-2026-00000
# # exp:2026-12-31 limits the ignore to that date
# AVD-DS-0002 exp:2026-12-31
